WEBVTT

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.360
"Dear Mizuki Hase-sama...

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.860
It's hot there, so I hope you're doing okay.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.000
I'm the same as always.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.750
Summer vacation has begun, 
and I'm busier than ever.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.840
I like working at the express delivery company.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.060
The job's a little tough, but..."

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.450
Inaba!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.240
Yes?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.200
Did you deliver the seasonal gift to Saito-san?

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.080
Not yet! I still have three places to go!

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:37.510
<b>JTB High School English Conversation Club 
Cross-Cultural Communication</b>

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.970
"At the English Conversation Club,

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:37.510
we had a cross-cultural communication 
party with local foreigners."

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.190
Inaba-kun, we need more meat here.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:46.840
Stop eating so much and help, damn it!

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:53.220
"It's rough, but each day is full.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.470
I'll send another letter later.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.040
I hope you'll read it.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.310
Yushi Inaba."

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.540
Full, huh?

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.530
That Inaba...

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:06.460
I wish he would just call me.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:42.930
<b>Third Haunting 
Kuri and Shiro</b>

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.750
This is paradise...

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:57.810
Man, I never tire of taking morning baths.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:59.390
Right?

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.310
Want to join us?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.140
I'll wash your back.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.570
A little too forward?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:13.030
No, that's just how Kuri and Shiro are.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.610
They're actually really good kids.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.200
Thank you!

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.190
It's so hot...

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.230
It sure is hot, right?

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:39.370
Let's have ice cream when we get back.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.100
Okay! Let's get back fast!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.030
Oh, Inaba...

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:45.980
Takenaka?

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.280
You're working in this heat?

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.680
That's impressive.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.660
I seriously respect that.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.570
It isn't that impressive.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.500
Anyway...

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.590
Don't you think it's time you introduced 
me to your apartment building?

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.010
What pretty girls live there?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.420
I know one makes you all 
those delicious lunches.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.830
Don't you live with another high school girl?

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:13.650
It isn't fair to have all the fun! 
Introduce me, too!

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:17.970
S-Sorry... But as you can see, I'm busy.

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:21.770
<i>I can't bring you to the 
ghost-filled Yokai Apartments!</i>

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:26.520
Good luck with your job.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.410
Hey, guys.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.150
He's...

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:34.750
Hey, Inaba! We're getting back to work!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:35.930
Right!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.690
I'm exhausted...

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.290
Today was harder than usual.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.360
Welcome back.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.520
I-I'm back.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.530
I really can't introduce him to this, huh?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.820
<b> Sigh...</b>

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:15.240
I guess summer vacation's over, right?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.130
Yeah.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.660
It passed quickly.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:20.770
You're leaving soon, aren't you?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.000
Yes.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.140
But it was fun, wasn't it?

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.540
Yes!

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.570
I met ghosts like him, 
who're like real kids.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.010
What's wrong, Shiro?

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.690
Ah, Akane-san's here?

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.030
Akane-san?

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:41.870
That's right.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.520
I guess you could say she's 
Kuri and Shiro's mother.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:51.760
Oh? I guess even ghosts have mothers.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:52.980
What's she like...

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:01.730
You are the new resident?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.790
How cute you are.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:08.240
Hey, Akane-san! Hello.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.240
This is Yushi Inaba-kun.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.460
H-Hello... Nice to meet you.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.070
Oh, Kuri...

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:18.040
Have you been well? Want a lollipop?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.920
Originally, Akane-san was a 
spirit beast at Oogami Shrine.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:23.890
A spirit beast?

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:26.630
A mountain dog. In other words, a wolf.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.020
A wolf?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.070
Is she really Kuri's mom?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.930
Of course not.

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.830
Fukase-san...

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:38.660
If Mom's here, that means 
it's coming tonight.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:43.140
Yushi-kun will see something unpleasant, huh?

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:46.670
Wh-What do you mean by 
"something unpleasant"?

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:49.180
Kuri's...

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.590
Kuri's true mother.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.080
A certain young, unmarried girl 
gave birth to Kuri.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.730
Why?

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.300
You said you'd get married 
if we got pregnant!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.860
Shut up and leave!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:08.220
Why...

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.360
Why am I the only one this happens to?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.140
Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.930
If it weren't for you, I'd...

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:21.950
If it weren't for you!

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.590
You don't mean...

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.580
That's right.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.520
She grew to hate Kuri

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:31.380
and took her anger out on him.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:38.740
Eventually, Kuri became a boy who 
couldn't speak or express anything.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:46.540
He never received love. 
Not even once, in his whole life.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:49.980
So at a very young age, he became lost.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:58.970
It was Shiro, a wild dog, who brought 
him warmth and looked after him.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.950
The species didn't matter, 
as long as there was love.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:09.920
But one day, his mother finally went mad.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.830
And Kuri...

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:21.050
Shiro ripped out the mother's throat.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:25.380
When the other adults saw this, 
they beat him to death.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:30.050
He didn't resist at all and 
let the humans kill him.

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:37.440
Wh-Why?

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.630
Shiro...

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:45.540
could not abandon Kuri in death.

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:51.210
Shiro chose to die, so the young 
child's soul would not be lost,

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.130
and he could protect Kuri.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.250
But that was not the end.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:04.270
Even in death, Kuri's mother chased him.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.970
In search of help,

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:11.350
Shiro took Kuri to Oogami, 
the great god who rules all dogs.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:18.640
I had just lost my own child, 
and I wanted to help them.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.270
Oogami-sama granted my wish,

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:26.240
entrusting Kuri and Shiro to me.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.280
So I sent the pair

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:32.130
to Kotobuki-so, with which I 
had an existing relationship.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:38.100
I thought that Kuri needed human 
love now, more than anything.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.930
"Kuri" was the name I chose, since his 
eyes are "kurikuri," or big and round.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.010
Um...

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.470
Can't we do something about the mother?

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.570
Annihilating her would be a simple matter.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.950
But that won't save Kuri.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.360
It's an impurity, her madness 
given physical form.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:04.720
As long as it is here, his soul 
cannot go to heaven.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.830
We must wait for her obsession to waver.

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.640
I do not know how many decades, 
perhaps centuries, it will take.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.250
That's...

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.330
How can she hate her own child so much?!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.890
Because he is her child.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.730
The tie of mother to child is the sole thing

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.770
letting her bind his soul so strongly.

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:29.560
<i>But that's...</i>

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.300
<i>That's just...</i>

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.240
We shall not sleep tonight.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:41.320
Kuri's mother will soon appear.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.830
We shall protect Kuri from her.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.250
We must prepare to meet this evil spirit!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.240
Okay! Everyone, bring the sake!

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.300
Meet her... How?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.500
By not doing a thing.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:11:00.760
A vengeful spirit can't break the 
barrier around this building.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.420
The most she can do is wander 
around the front gate.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:09.700
And so, each time, we get to 
have a party and watch her!

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.730
That sounds kind of mean.

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.770
Nah... Think of it as a cheerful 
banquet to drive off evil.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.770
It is best that you not see.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.100
It is not a pleasant thing.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:26.950
May I watch, too?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.500
Very well.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.430
This will be a good lesson for you.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.990
You're sure, Akane-san?

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:44.300
It's gonna be one hell of a lesson.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.340
Mommy can be a nasty lady.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:02.970
Inaba!

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.820
<i>My first spring in middle school, 
my parents died in a car accident.</i>

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:15.220
<i>It was so sudden that, even though I was sad,</i>

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.680
<i>I couldn't cry.</i>

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.440
<i>But...</i>

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:29.890
<i>I'm sure Mom and Dad died regretful...</i>

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:34.400
<i>That they had to die and leave me alone.</i>

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:37.920
Yushi-kun, are you there?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.250
Yeah.

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:46.160
I heard you're staying up to 
wait for Kuri's mom tonight.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.010
Yes.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.880
My job is putting up a barrier

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.500
in my room and protecting Kuri there.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.800
You should stay with me.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.670
No, I want to see it.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.620
Yeah?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.700
<i>Maybe it's just the desire 
to see something scary.</i>

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.640
<i>But I want to see it.</i>

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:11.520
<b></b>

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:11.290
<i>A mother, since I no longer have one.</i>

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:23.610
Yushi-kun, getting enough to eat?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.650
Yes! It's good!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.490
Don't eat too much. You'll regret it later.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:36.940
The snacks the local dogs 
brought are good, too.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.730
Akane-sama is a servant of the dog god.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.830
It is natural to bear gifts for her.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:46.670
This is some good venison!

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.880
That's Ruriko-chan for you.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:53.240
Her ten white fingers are like a 
conductor's baton, making music.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.460
Like the globes of Arachne,

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.610
creating mystery, delight, and astonishment.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.230
Right?

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:05.950
Hello, everyone. I smell something good.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.270
Antiquary! Come join the fun!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.790
Hello, Akane-dono.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.540
You're as beautiful as ever.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.630
Antiquary, you never change, either.

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:21.790
If Akane-dono is here, is it time again?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.630
Yeah, sure is. Have a drink.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.290
I'll take you up on that.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.200
I have salted dragon eyeballs.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.300
Who wants one?

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.630
Heck, no!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:38.260
<i>It seems the same as any day 
at the Yokai Apartments.</i>

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.890
<i>Even though a vengeful spirit is coming...</i>

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.330
<i>It's just like them.</i>

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.440
What is that?

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.530
Oh, that's Ryu-san's shikigami.

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:51.880
Shikigami?

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:54.870
Hmm, do you know what a familiar is?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.520
Oh, like an onmyoji uses?

00:14:57.520 --> 00:15:00.970
It's a divine spirit that obeys its 
master's will, you could say.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:06.960
I guess Ryu-san can't be here tonight, 
so he sent his shikigami.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.780
Sometimes, it fights for us!

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.720
Like in a battle manga?

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.330
What's wrong?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.730
Akane-san?

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.640
You're here!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.650
She's here?

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.240
Kuri's mother?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.770
S-So that's...

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:59.040
Kuri's mother.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.600
She's a mess, isn't she?

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.050
To think it's a mother wanting 
to see her son...

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:24.630
How sad.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.800
At first, she was still human.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.960
But as time passed, she began to fall apart.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.890
His poor mother...

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.010
Stop it.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.960
Just because it hurts...

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:46.900
Just because you're his mother...

00:16:47.210 --> 00:16:49.820
It doesn't mean you can do whatever 
you want to your kid!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:53.760
You can't... You can't do that.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:55.170
Just stop already!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:57.920
Stop it.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:58.650
But...

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.840
It won't hear your words.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.420
That thing isn't even human anymore.

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.600
No thoughts or emotions are left.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:14.350
It doesn't know what it is or why it's lost.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:17.410
All that's left is its obsession with Kuri.

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.960
But...

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.970
Enough! Begone!

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:25.440
You are a failure as a woman!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:30.020
Begone!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:33.450
Your punishment is endless suffering!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.750
Scary.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.060
It's mother versus mother.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:39.270
You won't find a scarier match-up.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.480
Whew... Over again, huh?

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.330
Okay, let's toast again!

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:00.300
You must also be tired...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.240
Get some rest.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:06.180
Please look after Kuri and Shiro 
in the future, as well.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.100
All right.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.030
Oh, Yushi-kun...

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.450
I'll give you a talisman to help 
you sleep well tonight.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:23.780
The Fairy King's Dream Stone.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.620
You will have pleasant dreams.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:38.290
Yes?

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:41.920
Yushi-kun, is it over?

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.780
That wasn't much fun, was it?

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.850
Those guys have the worst taste in hobbies!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.600
Y-Yeah...

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.370
<i>Even after losing her humanity,</i>

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.060
<i>she still misses her child.</i>

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.990
<i>But her motherly feelings are wrong.</i>

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:03.570
<i>It's so sad!</i>

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:09.830
<i>Was there no love there?</i>

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.120
<i>No, I hope there was.</i>

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.370
<i>Even a little!</i>

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.470
<i>I miss you, Mom.</i>

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:28.470
Why?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.990
Yushi-kun...

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:34.030
S-Sorry.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.820
I... I...

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.160
It's fine.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.180
You can cry when you want to cry.

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:58.830
<i>That night, I had a dream.</i>

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:04.260
<i>I was still in high school, and my 
parents and Hase were there.</i>

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:07.090
<i>I don't remember what we said,</i>

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.020
<i>but we laughed the whole time.</i>

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.240
<i>For so long.</i>

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:23.360
Chirpity-chirp! Chirpity-chirp!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.280
Mm... I'm full, chirp.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.780
You need to eat your fill, chirp...

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:30.780
But I'm on a diet, chirpity-chirp.

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:32.260
You guys again?!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.210
Chirpity-chirp!

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:35.630
Huh?

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.470
My room?

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.000
When did I...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.930
I'm late!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.150
<i>It's my ordinary life.</i>

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:48.740
But no one's forgotten Kuri's 
mother's visit, last night.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:52.360
Everyone's seriously mad, worried,

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.410
and they're treating the visit as reality.

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:59.100
Morning, Yushi-kun! Sleep well?

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.310
Good morning.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:04.480
Um, last night, what happened?

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:08.040
You cried yourself to sleep!

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.360
But you looked cute sleeping.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.450
I'm so sorry!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.830
Then, how did I end up asleep in my room?

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.130
Because Akira-san carried you.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:23.020
This is the problem with kids.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:28.950
I cried myself to sleep on a girl's lap, 
and was carried back to my room?

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.630
This can't be happening!

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:13.720
Six months have flown by.

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:16.530
Now it's time for the boy to leave paradise.

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:18.000
Um, Akira-san?

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:20.070
Farewell, Yokai Apartments.

00:23:20.070 --> 00:23:21.810
Farewell, Yushi Inaba.

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:24.750
Farewell, summer days of youth.

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:25.520
Just kidding.

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:27.790
It isn't the last episode yet!

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.630
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.490
This Side.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.010
<b>Fourth Haunting 
This Side</b>

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:35.300
Everyone, thank you for everything!
